query I
SELECT count(DISTINCT function_name) FROM duckdb_functions() WHERE function_name = 'DropTopology' AND contains(regexp_replace(examples[1], '\s+', ' ', 'g'), 'CALL CreateTopology(''city'')');
----
1

statement ok
